Interconnection Service Agreement: Executed Summary
Doc no. ISA-Halbray-Field-Site-3 · Rev Final · Date 11/18/2024 · Owner: DER Program Office, Contracts
Term Entry
Agreement No. ISA-Halbray-Field-Site-3
Project Halbray Field Solar Site 3 (PXA-2024-0002)
Interconnection customer Halbray Community Solar LP
Capacity 2.3 MW ac (2,300 kW), export at the point of interconnection
Feeder ALN-159
Utility facilities Utility-owned RTU and POI recloser (TCS-02, DPS-07); revenue meter
RM-0002 at the point of interconnection
Customer facilities Four inverter skids, the 800 V ac collection system, switchboard CSB-1
and the step-up transformer with its 13.2 kV primary switch
Pre-PTO backfeed On the interconnection customer's written request, the Company may
energize the customer's facilities from the feeder for construction and
commissioning power before permission to operate. During a backfeed
the generating facility stays disabled and does not operate in parallel;
parallel operation begins only with the Company's written permission to
operate. Distribution Operations performs the switching for a backfeed
under its own switching order.
Executed 11/18/2024, for Alleniom Utilities by the DER Program Office (Contracts)
and for Halbray Community Solar LP